ng_hci: SCO and eSCO connection requests with parameters from the sco hook

Take NGM_HCI_LP_SYNC_CON_REQ and NGM_HCI_LP_SYNC_CON_RSP
(ng_hci_sync_lp.h, this directory's src/, shared with NgBtsocket) on the
upstream hooks: ng_btsocket_sco sends them for a socket with
SO_SCO_SYNC_PARAMS set, and ng_hci_sync.c turns them into
Setup_Synchronous_Connection and Accept_Synchronous_Connection_Request
with the socket's air coding, packet types, latency and retransmission
effort.

Origin: NextBSD (nextbsd/nextbsd-kernel#237). Not upstream.
Applies to: releng/15.1 sys/netgraph/bluetooth/hci/ng_hci_main.c

--- a/sys/netgraph/bluetooth/hci/ng_hci_main.c
+++ b/sys/netgraph/bluetooth/hci/ng_hci_main.c
@@ -54,6 +54,10 @@
 /* NextBSD: LE hardening (nextbsd/nextbsd-kernel#234) */
 #include "ng_hci_le_lp.h"
 #include "ng_hci_le.h"
+
+/* NextBSD: synchronous connections (nextbsd/nextbsd-kernel#237) */
+#include "ng_hci_sync_lp.h"
+#include "ng_hci_sync.h"
 
 /******************************************************************************
  ******************************************************************************
@@ -694,6 +698,15 @@ ng_hci_upper_rcvmsg(node_p node, item_p item, hook_p l
 					lasthook);
 			break;
 
+		/* NextBSD: from ng_btsocket_sco, SCO and eSCO links (#237) */
+		case NGM_HCI_LP_SYNC_CON_REQ:
+			error = ng_hci_sync_lp_con_req(unit, item, lasthook);
+			break;
+
+		case NGM_HCI_LP_SYNC_CON_RSP:
+			error = ng_hci_sync_lp_con_rsp(unit, item, lasthook);
+			break;
+
 		default:
 			error = ng_hci_default_rcvmsg(node, item, lasthook);
 			break;
